{"id":"wb-6-837","name":"升仙太子碑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"升仙太子碑","text":"升仙太子碑位于中华人民共和国河南省洛阳市偃师区府店镇南缑山上，立于武周圣历二年（699年），碑额由武则天用飞白书书写“升仙太子之碑”6个大字，碑阳为正文，亦由武则天题写，碑阴的《游仙篇》杂言诗、题名等则分别出自当时的书法名家薛曜和钟绍京之手。升仙太子碑于2006年被公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%87%E4%BB%99%E5%A4%AA%E5%AD%90%E7%A2%91","revisionId":91950576,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91950576","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/65150eec7a28c51ad3666add.jpg","title":"20231119_Shengxian_Taizi_Tablet_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20231119_Shengxian_Taizi_Tablet_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/20231119_Shengxian_Taizi_Tablet_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Shengxian Taizi Tablet, calligraphy by Wu Zetian.","width":320,"height":213}}